flowchart LR
    PR[PR + merge queue]
    CI[CI quality gates]
    Nightly[Nightly heavy checks]
    RC[Release branch]
    Dry[Registry dry-runs]
    Docs[Docs version build]
    Artifacts[Native artifacts + checksums]
    SBOM[SBOM/provenance]
    Release[GitHub Release]
    Publish[crates/PyPI/npm/NuGet/R/Julia/Go]

    PR --> CI --> RC
    Nightly --> RC
    RC --> Dry
    RC --> Docs
    RC --> Artifacts
    RC --> SBOM
    Dry --> Release
    Docs --> Release
    Artifacts --> Release
    SBOM --> Release
    Release --> Publish
